# Power BI: .pbip projects (TMDL/PBIR) are text and committed; these are
# per-machine local cache/credential artifacts Power BI Desktop generates
# next to them and must never be committed.
**/.pbi/localSettings.json
**/*.pbix
**/CachedData/
**/*.abf
